    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_bit_code_abbrev_op" kindref="compound">BitCodeAbbrevOp</ref> - This describes one or more operands in an abbreviation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is actually a union of two different things:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>It could be a literal integer value (&quot;the operand is always 17&quot;).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>It could be an encoding specification (&quot;this operand encoded like so&quot;). </para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
